This section provides an overview of the notations and symbols used in this
thesis.

#table(
  columns: (2cm, 1fr, 3cm),
  align: (left, left, left),
  stroke: none,
  inset: 4pt,
  [*Symbol*], [*Description*], [*Unit*],
  [$J$], [Hopping integral], [eV],
  [$U$], [On-site repulsion], [eV],
  [$mu$], [Chemical potential], [eV],
  [$n_max$], [Fock-space truncation], [-],
  [$chi$], [DMRG bond dimension], [-],
)

#v(1em)

Note: Bold symbols represent vectors, and capital bold symbols represent
matrices.
